      "description": "<p><strong>Changelog:</strong></p>\n<p>To anyone that was having issues with performance before, please try this update and let me know how it is now. Personally I’ve seen a pretty big improvement.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GetNativeTexturePtr was being called every frame a lot more than it should’ve been, I think this was the biggest hit on performance people were experiencing</li>\n<li>Various other small optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n",
